# Issue #787: the same reporter-position path when the call is over-applied. It must reach a
# runtime `ol-too-many-inputs` whose `params.callable` is the CANONICAL `forward`, never the
# surface `fd` — the rule #670/#733/#741 established for structured params. Before the fix this
# program crashed the host with a raw `TypeError` instead.
define forward
  return 55
end
print (fd 1 2)
